│ value, the method should return a final_result to stop the         │
│ multi-turn delegation.                                             │
│                                                                    │
│ Therefore, the fix is to enhance                                   │
│ _handle_agent_response_and_continue to detect if the a2a_result    │
│ status is "completed" and return the final_result accordingly,     │
│ even if is_a2a is True.                                            │
│                                                                    │
